<title>USA: Dun &amp; Bradstreet to buy up to 9.8 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Dun &amp; Bradstreet to buy up to 9.8 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MURRAY HILL, N.J. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp said Wednesday its board approved continuing the company's stock repurchase plan, authorizing the buyback of up to 9.8 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The stock would be held as treasury stock and issued if employee options and compensation plans are exercized, the company said.  </p>
<p>The company has about 170 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
